[en.CHARACTER_SENDAK_NAME]
Sendak

[en.CHARACTER_SENDAK_DESC]
Sendak, the mentor and enlightener of Tirek in his youth, taught Tirek the spells to extract magic from creatures. When he found that Tirek’s talent was far above his own, he felt first proud, then fearful, but finally — ambition.
He hoped to train Tirek as his protégé, while he manipulated the puppet strings behind the scenes, to one day replace that old thing Vorak and become the supreme leader of the centaurs. However, the young and arrogant Tirek revealed his evil ability to extract magic too early, and betrayed his mentor — after the explosion in the cave, facing the angry King Vorak, Tirek shifted all the blame to Sendak, who was then imprisoned for hundreds of years.
It was not until Tirek seized power and King Vorak abdicated that Sendak was able to see the light of day again. However, he no longer had gratitude for his protégé in his heart, only the resentment of the betrayal, and his ambition that never dissipated.

[zh.CHARACTER_SENDAK_NAME]
僧达克

[zh.CHARACTER_SENDAK_DESC]
僧达克，提雷克的年轻时的师父与启蒙者，传授提雷克从生物身上吸取魔法的法术。当他发现提雷克的天赋远在自己之上时，感受到了首先是骄傲，接着是恐惧，但最后是——野望。
他希望将提雷克培养成自己的学徒，而自己则在幕后操控着木偶绳，有朝一日取代那个老东西沃拉克，成为半人马的至高领袖。然而，年轻气盛的提雷克过早地表露出了吸取魔法的邪恶能力，并且背叛了自己的师父——在山洞爆炸案后，面对愤怒地沃拉克国王，提雷克将责任全部推卸到僧达克身上，让他入狱数百年之久。
直到提雷克夺取大权，沃拉克国王退位时大赦天下，僧达克才得以重见天日。然而，他的心中早已没有了对学徒的感激，只留下了对当初背叛的怨恨，和他那从未消散的野望。
